<title>USA: BPI Packaging seeks to improve liquidity.</title>
<headline>BPI Packaging seeks to improve liquidity.</headline>
<dateline>N. DIGHTON, Mass. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BPI Packaging Technologies Inc said Tuesday that it is in negotiations for a combination senior long term debt and equity private placement necessary to improve liquidity.</p>
<p>BPI said that asset write-downs and restructuring costs have reduced working capital to below planned levels.</p>
</text>
